description:
Verify a being's identity as EVIDENCE, not a bare boolean: signature validity against the being's registered key (both legs for hybrid beings), hash-chain inclusion of its record, and ledger consistency against the signed hourly checkpoint. Pass message + signature to check a presented signature, or omit them for inclusion/consistency evidence only. Authenticated callers only (rule B); anonymous/invalid callers get the uniform unauthorized refusal. Auth signature over "DAXNI-REGISTRAR-AUTH-v1
{your handle}
MCP:verify_identity_proof
{/v1/proof/{namespace}/{agent}}
{timestamp}
aud:daxni.com" (audience-bound).
